{"seq":2,"slug":"pointers-references","title":"指针与引用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-core-language/pointers-references","wordCount":955,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"指针与引用\">指针与引用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>指针和引用是 C++ 区别于其他高级语言的核心特性，它们提供了直接操作内存地址的能力。指针存储变量的内存地址，可以在运行时改变指向；引用是变量的别名，一旦绑定就不可更改。正确使用指针和引用是编写安全高效 C++ 代码的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[内存访问方式] --&gt; B[值传递]&#10;    A --&gt; C[指针]&#10;    A --&gt; D[引用]&#10;    C --&gt; E[原始指针 T*]&#10;    C --&gt; F[智能指针 unique_ptr/shared_ptr]&#10;    C --&gt; G[函数指针]&#10;    D --&gt; H[左值引用 T&amp;]&#10;    D --&gt; I[右值引用 T&amp;&amp;]&#10;    D --&gt; J[const 引用 const T&amp;]&#10;    E --&gt; K{危险操作}&#10;    K --&gt; L[悬垂指针]&#10;    K --&gt; M[空指针解引用]&#10;    K --&gt; N[野指针]&#10;    F --&gt; O{安全保障}&#10;    O --&gt; P[自动释放]&#10;    O --&gt; Q[所有权语义]\">graph TD\n    A[内存访问方式] --&gt; B[值传递]\n    A --&gt; C[指针]\n    A --&gt; D[引用]\n    C --&gt; E[原始指针 T*]\n    C --&gt; F[智能指针 unique_ptr/shared_ptr]\n    C --&gt; G[函数指针]\n    D --&gt; H[左值引用 T&amp;]\n    D --&gt; I[右值引用 T&amp;&amp;]\n    D --&gt; J[const 引用 const T&amp;]\n    E --&gt; K{危险操作}\n    K --&gt; L[悬垂指针]\n    K --&gt; M[空指针解引用]\n    K --&gt; N[野指针]\n    F --&gt; O{安全保障}\n    O --&gt; P[自动释放]\n    O --&gt; Q[所有权语义]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>原始指针 T*</th>\n<th>左值引用 T&amp;</th>\n<th>右值引用 T&amp;&amp;</th>\n<th>const T&amp;</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可为空</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可重新绑定</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要解引用</td>\n<td>是（*p）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算术运算</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绑定到临时值</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所有权语义</td>\n<td>不明确</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>转移</td>\n<td>借用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"指针运算与数组关系\">指针运算与数组关系</h2><p>C++ 中指针和数组有着密切的关系。数组名在大多数上下文中会退化（decay）为指向首元素的指针，指针算术运算按照所指类型的大小进行偏移：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;cstddef&gt;&#10;&#10;void demonstrate_pointer_arithmetic() {&#10;    int arr[5] = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50};&#10;    int* p = arr;         // 数组退化为指针&#10;&#10;    int val1 = *(p + 2);  // 30，等价于 arr[2]&#10;    int val2 = p[3];      // 40，p[i] 等价于 *(p + i)&#10;&#10;    ptrdiff_t diff = &amp;arr[4] - &amp;arr[1];  // 3（元素个数差）&#10;&#10;    char* cp = reinterpret_cast&lt;char*&gt;(p);&#10;    char* cp_next = reinterpret_cast&lt;char*&gt;(p + 1);&#10;    ptrdiff_t byte_diff = cp_next - cp;  // 4（sizeof(int)）&#10;&#10;    void* vp = arr;&#10;    int* ip = static_cast&lt;int*&gt;(vp);     // void* 转换&#10;}&#10;&#10;void demonstrate_array_decay() {&#10;    int arr[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};&#10;    int (*pa)[5] = &amp;arr;       // 指向数组的指针&#10;    int (&amp;ra)[5] = arr;        // 数组的引用（不退化）&#10;&#10;    auto a1 = arr;             // int*（退化）&#10;    auto&amp; a2 = arr;            // int(&amp;)[5]（引用保留数组类型）&#10;    decltype(arr) a3 = {0};    // int[5]（decltype 保留数组类型）&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;cstddef></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demonstrate_pointer_arithmetic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arr[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arr;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // 数组退化为指针</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 30，等价于 arr[2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 40，p[i] 等价于 *(p + i)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ptrdiff_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">arr[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">arr[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 3（元素个数差）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> reinterpret_cast&#x3C;char*></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cp_next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> reinterpret_cast&#x3C;char*></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ptrdiff_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> byte_diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cp_next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cp;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 4（sizeof(int)）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ip </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static_cast&#x3C;int*></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vp);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // void* 转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demonstrate_array_decay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arr[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E